      "content": "Interesting. You didn't really mention Marcus or Aarav in your top picks. Both of them have MBAs from incredible schools like Harvard and Stanford and have clearly been successful in high-pressure environments. Why do you think they'd lack the presence or \"fit\" that Julian and Chloe have for a boardroom setting?",
